  "Deal Curse damage to 1 foe equal to <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> of ATK.\\nIf the target has [Sin], inflict $2 [Bad Karma] stacks, then copy target's [Bad Karma] stacks to other foes with [Sin].\\nIf the target has [Bad Karma], increase this damage by $3.\\n[Bad Karma]: Decrease DEF by <color=#FFFC40>$4</color> for $7 turns (based on Aran's Ailment ACC, up to <color=#FFFC40>$6</color> bonus Defense Down at <color=#FFFC40>$5</color> Ailment ACC). Stacks up to $8 times.\\n<b><size=28><color=#850101>Shadows surge from the cracks of the forbidden grimoire, transforming into countless fine black scorch marks, branding themselves onto the sinner.</color></size></b>": "",
